<Page title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How GarageRecoveryLab earns money and how that does and does not affect our reviews." updated="November 24, 2026">
  <p>GarageRecoveryLab is reader-supported. When you buy a product through some links on this site, we may earn a commission from the seller. The price you pay is the same.</p>
  <h2>What this means for our reviews</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Commissions never decide rankings. We include products we earn nothing from when they are the better choice.</li>
    <li>Brands cannot pay for placement, a higher score, or approval of a review before it is published.</li>
    <li>If a brand gives us a product to test, we say so in that review.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Affiliate programs we participate in</h2>
  <p>We work with affiliate networks and brand programs such as Impact, Awin and Refersion. Affiliate links on this site are marked as sponsored to search engines.</p>
  <p>This disclosure follows the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's guidance on endorsements. Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
</Page>
